
flowchart ID
    A[main: glfwInit + crate window] --> B[initVulkan: instance, surface, device, swapchain]
    B --> C[recordClearCommandBuffers: one cmd buffer per swapchain image]
    C --> D[render loop]
    D --> E[glfwPollEvents]
    E --> F[drawFrame: acquire image, submit, present]
    F --> G{Escape pressed or window closed?}
    G == no ==> D
    G == yes ==> H[cleanup: destroy swapchain, device,surface, instance, window]
    H --> I[end]
